<description>&lt;p&gt;Israeli forces are expanding operations in southern Syria, threatening new territory in Syria, Lebanon and Gaza, while a Syrian security officer was killed in a coastal attack and another patrol attack in western Syria wounded four. Syrian Christian leaders condemned recent attacks on their community, and a Syrian security officer was killed on the coast. The UN deputy relief chief warned that Syrians cannot afford more instability. The UCDP recorded 2,732 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxPd0k4MkFvZUNzUmQ3SFlLTC1wU3JtU1FpWWl0a0V1RDVwRjJ1b2I2Yl9JT1lxclhPOEJ0QnBLTDJrY013T3REUDNtd1FxRlhjMFp3alJlNV9aVHo2T2Q0U1ljRHVMOVdKWHdpb05LU3pqVk1IeUxGeFJrNG5ZaVJIQ2E0Um00RWZNWl9TemVxSzgtWjcyb1Z5VWZ6T3pHcENnZ2t5TlI0XzF0T1JOc3RFRTU3dk9TdlEz0gG-AUFVX3lxTE82MEhKTi1BUVBaaG9NRkFHeGdoYk9ObDFzaDkxclhWZ0QyaHZIY3NkVjJkMEVwUUtQci1KUjRYTjkydjBQTV9LYlRmcXdnZEVqSnowMVg3NjFPUkloLVRtMzRjZEFOVlhCUmJvTXBDWU5XcGtBMEtHR2xRbG44OXZZdWlGdkF3d0YxZlFQLWUyTnBTalJzc1FwUVEzQXp1OVNJbWtMOXJLVnNheDdvcUdReUhNakxiOVJlN201UFE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE9ydE5xZ1g5SV9vbnY4dzc1bmxkSWVEUFBTdWFZRkN1RUhFWXJUUENIb09OYnpYc0dOOVFlMGpQMEg0YzV4bVdPNg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Haaretz&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxQM1dHMVdKTGxYRUFxYURFelNiTWlEdXcxMG9vb25BT29hNjhOaG9XSV92TVpxb2V2bGpwT1BvZTNiUjF1dDlIUzNkek80anFYTmF3TnY1WHR1bXpwRExUMXoySGpObXIwSEJ3ZTJCakhBY1dEajhRamRXMDdCbVhMSjlLTEcwSVdVeWk2TlI0ZlRKb2M2WTV1cVNjRjJWbF9paDBmZEswSk1vYVZEQzJ6RHN3?oc=5&quot;&gt;OCHA&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New Arab&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;صوت الإما